{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13416","headline":"杨参军庄送宇文邈 · 姚系","name":"杨参军庄送宇文邈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋云冒原隰，野鸟满林声。\n爱此田舍事，稽君车马程。\n离堂惨不喧，脉脉复盈盈。\n兰叶一经霜，香销爲赠轻。\n灯光耿方寂，虫思隐余清。\n相望忽无际，如含江海情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚系","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13416.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13416","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}